    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/4/74994.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 141,
    "turn_text": "So the thing about entrepreneurs, we know a lot of people and we recognize each other when we see each other. And we are, a lot of us, whether you're an introvert or not, if you're a small business owner entrepreneur, you know how to get business done. You try to go, you try to get business done. But I think a lot of us that it's like, it's almost like, oh my gosh, you finally figured it out. You're in america and you realize that america is a business and if you're not live if you're not leveraging the tools that america has created. To make it possible for you to have a small business or start a small business maintain growing scale one or even as an entrepreneur you make enough money. you know, to cover the food on your table as an entrepreneur. If you're not recognizing these tools, then you're not taking advantage of what this country has to offer.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
