    "turn_idx": 156,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, my best memory was the first walleye I caught down there in the second grade with my grandma. My grandparents used to fish down there a lot, mostly for my grandpa later in Western Kentucky. But the late cumble, that's easily my best memory of late Cumberland. The natural falls down there are really, really pretty. I think one of the prettiest things you can see late Cumberland though is when there's a there's a full moon out over late Cumberland. And you can see it in that light is just really cool.",
